      "question": "During morning walk, Avni walked 100 m in 10 minutes. At this rate what distance will she cover in 3 hours?",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "1",
          "text": "18 km"
        },
        {
          "label": "2",
          "text": "1.8 km"
        },
        {
          "label": "3",
          "text": "0.18 km"
        },
        {
          "label": "4",
          "text": "300 m"
        }
      ],
      "correct": "3",
      "solution": "Avni walks:\n\n100 m in 10 min → 10 m per minute\n\nNow convert 3 hours to minutes:\n\n3 hours = 180 minutes\n\nDistance covered:\n\n10 m/min × 180 min = 1800 m\n\n0.18 km.\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 3\"**",
      "tags": [
        "Quant Based Puzzle"
      ]
    },
